        "message": "docs(registry-wg): remove @tadasant from Registry WG Leads (#3175)\n\n* docs(registry-wg): remove @tadasant from Registry WG leadership\n\n@tadasant is stepping down as Registry WG co-lead; @rdimitrov becomes the\nsole Lead. @tadasant remains an MCP maintainer and a Registry WG member,\nand stays champion of the Server Card / server.json alignment work item.\n\nLeadership-only change: the Membership row moves from Lead to WG Member\nand the Emeritus table is untouched.\n\n* Update registry.mdx\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Tadas Antanavicius <jon@tadasant.com>",
