        },
        "message": "Add blog post announcing Ruby SDK 1.0\n\nAnnounce the first stable release of the MCP Ruby SDK: a stable public API\nunder the Semantic Versioning policy, a 100% server and client conformance\npass rate, and the Tier 2 assessment (#3127).\n\nIf accepted, this post is intended to be published after #3128, which moves\nthe Ruby SDK to Tier 2 in the official SDK listing, is merged.",
