    {
      "sha": "240b88a3568d33c5b52ad699cfa6ed272f45e34c",
      "node_id": "C_kwDOM2nIG9oAKDI0MGI4OGEzNTY4ZDMzYzViNTJhZDY5OWNmYTZlZDI3MmY0NWUzNGM",
      "commit": {
        "author": {
          "name": "olaservo",
          "email": "olahungerford@gmail.com",
          "date": "2026-08-14T18:03:05Z"
        },
        "committer": {
          "name": "olaservo",
          "email": "olahungerford@gmail.com",
          "date": "2026-08-14T18:03:05Z"
        },
        "message": "Move the Node floor off EOL 20 to 24\n\nCONTRIBUTING.md already states \"Node.js 24 or above\" and .nvmrc pins\nv24.2.0, but package.json still declared `engines.node: \">=20\"` and three\nworkflow entries still provisioned Node 20. Node 20 reached end of life on\n2026-04-30, so the release-cutting job in particular was running on an\nunsupported runtime.\n\nAlign the stragglers with the requirement the repo already documents:\n\n- package.json (and the lockfile root it mirrors): >=20 -> >=24\n- cut-release.yml: the `final` job's setup-node 20 -> 24\n- sep-lifecycle.yml / sep-lifecycle-manual.yml: NODE_VERSION 20 -> 24\n\nmain.yml, markdown-format.yml, and render-seps.yml were already on 24 and\nare unchanged. No dependency versions move; the lockfile diff is the root\n`engines` field only.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
        "tree": {
          "sha": "4fa8364be8ddcaafe3cbdc6fff6a565d3b9f02b8",
          "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/modelcontextprotocol/modelcontextprotocol/git/trees/4fa8364be8ddcaafe3cbdc6fff6a565d3b9f02b8"
        },
        "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/modelcontextprotocol/modelcontextprotocol/git/commits/240b88a3568d33c5b52ad699cfa6ed272f45e34c",
        "comment_count": 0,
        "verification": {
