          "date": "2026-08-14T18:39:21Z"
        },
        "message": "docs:add Linux support to build-server tutorial (#3243)\n\n* docs:add Linux support to build-server tutorial\n\nBuild Server docs said Claude Desktop for Linux is not available, but it is now available. Removed note about Linux availability for Claude for Desktop in multiple sections and updated configuration instructions for Linux users.\n\n* docs:add Linux support to build-server tutorial-draft\n\nBuild Server docs said Claude Desktop for Linux is not available, but it is now available. Removed note about Linux availability for Claude for Desktop in multiple sections and updated configuration instructions for Linux users. This commit fixed it in the draft version.\n\n* style: run prettier --write on build-server.mdx files",
        "tree": {
          "sha": "9cd94e587f4f5fb9365b26c13d022312b2661606",
