    {
      "sha": "0f25aa311ed6e5a80cb07286ecc2ee2acf8be166",
      "node_id": "C_kwDOM2nIG9oAKDBmMjVhYTMxMWVkNmU1YTgwY2IwNzI4NmVjYzJlZTJhY2Y4YmUxNjY",
      "commit": {
        "author": {
          "name": "Den Delimarsky",
          "email": "53200638+localden@users.noreply.github.com",
          "date": "2026-08-22T06:51:20Z"
        },
        "committer": {
          "name": "GitHub",
          "email": "noreply@github.com",
          "date": "2026-08-22T06:51:20Z"
        },
        "message": "Publish the roadmap for the next specification release (#3290)\n\nReplace the March 2026 roadmap with the five priority areas the Core Maintainers and Working Groups settled on for the next specification release: agentic messaging primitives, HTTP-native transport unification and hardening, agent identity and enterprise-ready security, improved primitives, and improved SDK developer experience. Each area names the maintainers holding it and the deliverables agreed for this cycle, alongside how the roadmap affects SEP prioritization.\n\nAlso move the roadmap out of its single-page sidebar group into the Community tab's renamed Shaping the Protocol group, alongside the design principles and SEP guidelines it points contributors to.\n\nNo-Verification-Needed: docs-only content and nav update\n\n:house: Remote-Dev: homespace",
        "tree": {
          "sha": "65128f87ce2599aefd7e317601a30ae57c422a6b",
          "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/modelcontextprotocol/modelcontextprotocol/git/trees/65128f87ce2599aefd7e317601a30ae57c422a6b"
        },
        "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/modelcontextprotocol/modelcontextprotocol/git/commits/0f25aa311ed6e5a80cb07286ecc2ee2acf8be166",
        "comment_count": 0,
        "verification": {
          "verified": true,
          "reason": "valid",
          "signature": "-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqiUboCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAzJwQAAuy6heFQ7Jyax7y070sGbrh\nF5jEarQfkoDqLRuRRZmpOG7dF29Mx3l7JK1Y4sU0kndctli989XaCIeu078SH+f6\n91EsteD7smiItSswRda5KeiNRoCC2Mkn8iAsSzU4YEfMt/K+uv/356lR7QMsYZFD\nlID72AZnvWSajO4HwWCYGPf9IgbW9U+5S/VrWwEXdhsJlVPJ4zytM0h5yjodNLYc\nz82lQknQPaVJNdWnQpaW8JOmkCmGGNOVsbXfgWmYwObelJBpOSkgOWmtqwXWKLI6\nQUVI6LOqRrCywxtHi30j7RTF3hyvwckGZ3IVMb+EbirGIFd95PJddC5igwEo/Qee\nOTiK8JDip/dIs2bxb5Mm0xJf+9kiuAbTA3UpGi3R4W5jdBgAM6qlaN/yeTjSg98X\nwHRyO4hOp8OY3zGdnNMCsW3V5d5t42OkilNYJwOxFMlZugXRfqaxyLH6wNUBfKJW\nrVBDGevJ2sxjM8buHuUQwgwP/9ln98OrRrTPUkFhO1GYHi7fONRJszN+trkXt++r\nVH60R0edFXoTw0euHV/kZdLm3fnOsKW7JJrF+7Iv/UnnIZB44UGVmhVATCaxM/Oe\n9aN6RRRNEZnkYMmZjALyvbYgUiEuCVmx/lGDOJv85xfF/8LIfIZY+m34Eq0Ly+Q+\nFn8qWBudOioXELxXxWFq\n=jVwo\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n",
          "payload": "tree 65128f87ce2599aefd7e317601a30ae57c422a6b\nparent 4e67bdc2f3403a8602f72025b28ac27fe7fd4e44\nauthor Den Delimarsky <53200638+localden@users.noreply.github.com> 1787381480 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787381480 +0000\n\nPublish the roadmap for the next specification release (#3290)\n\nReplace the March 2026 roadmap with the five priority areas the Core Maintainers and Working Groups settled on for the next specification release: agentic messaging primitives, HTTP-native transport unification and hardening, agent identity and enterprise-ready security, improved primitives, and improved SDK developer experience. Each area names the maintainers holding it and the deliverables agreed for this cycle, alongside how the roadmap affects SEP prioritization.\n\nAlso move the roadmap out of its single-page sidebar group into the Community tab's renamed Shaping the Protocol group, alongside the design principles and SEP guidelines it points contributors to.\n\nNo-Verification-Needed: docs-only content and nav update\n\n:house: Remote-Dev: homespace",
