          "email": "dtemesgen@bloomberg.net",
          "date": "2026-08-24T11:42:53Z"
        },
        "message": "docs: convert filesystems WG proposal into a charter\n\nFollow the Group Charter Template and the WG formation flow: move the\ndocument to docs/community/working-groups/filesystems.mdx and add the\nnavigation entry to docs/docs.json.\n\nFacilitator(s) becomes a Leadership table listing WG Leads. Adds the\nGroup Type, Out of Scope, Related Groups, Authority & Decision Rights,\nMembership, Operations, and Changelog sections.\n\nCorrect the referenced proposals against GitHub. SEP-1708 is closed,\nSEP-2571 and SEP-2532 are pull requests, and all three are now cited by\ntheir full titles. Drop the unverified method count for the files/*\nfamily.",
        "tree": {
          "sha": "cd903c2d9328a88252a8943193797b6998ded494",
          "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/modelcontextprotocol/modelcontextprotocol/git/trees/cd903c2d9328a88252a8943193797b6998ded494"
