        },
        "message": "Document Cargo (Rust) packages in registry package types\n\nThe registry has supported `registryType: \"cargo\"` since https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/registry/pull/1207,\nand it is live in production, but this page never listed it.\n\nThe section is reflected verbatim from the source of this page:\nhttps://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/registry/blob/main/docs/modelcontextprotocol-io/package-types.mdx",
