    {
      "sha": "ca4ab3027f7c844cd3039c956438d72e8253f7f5",
      "node_id": "C_kwDOM2nIG9oAKGNhNGFiMzAyN2Y3Yzg0NGNkMzAzOWM5NTY0MzhkNzJlODI1M2Y3ZjU",
      "commit": {
        "author": {
          "name": "Raghu Chandra",
          "email": "rchandrasekharan@gmail.com",
          "date": "2026-08-29T04:24:44Z"
        },
        "committer": {
          "name": "GitHub",
          "email": "noreply@github.com",
          "date": "2026-08-29T04:24:44Z"
        },
        "message": "docs(community): Add Enterprise Interest Group charter (#2626)\n\n* docs(community): Add Enterprise Interest Group charter\n\nCharter for the MCP Enterprise Interest Group, co-facilitated by Raghu Chandra and Yannj_Fr. Reviewed by 13 participants from Saxo Bank, Nordstrom, Boomi, Okta, Blue Shield of California, Silex Data Solutions, TraceForce, GNS-Foundation, EmpowerID, Solo.io, and Archestra.\n\n* Update docs/community/enterprise-ig/charter.mdx\n\nCo-authored-by: Joey Orlando <joseph.t.orlando@gmail.com>\n\n* Tighten scope to requirements-gap focus per review\n\n* Fix markdown formatting (prettier)\n\n* Incorporate review feedback: stateless transport, scope, related groups\n\n* Add opportunity framing to In-Scope per review\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Joey Orlando <joseph.t.orlando@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Ola Hungerford <olahungerford@gmail.com>",
        "tree": {
          "sha": "33fa47e0df65a17ad357cb52dae86be5d9c180b3",
          "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/modelcontextprotocol/modelcontextprotocol/git/trees/33fa47e0df65a17ad357cb52dae86be5d9c180b3"
        },
        "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/modelcontextprotocol/modelcontextprotocol/git/commits/ca4ab3027f7c844cd3039c956438d72e8253f7f5",
        "comment_count": 0,
        "verification": {
          "verified": true,
          "reason": "valid",
          "signature": "-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqkl8MCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAwgIQAAPplbnbziWyo32KdBFjSUlA\n3GtPRanfreDmFchyDI5W5pLFQ4L6JyNPEQ82Aqha7/N79p42GK/JHRhmbL6f8lal\n6JRfydeln891aneOYD7EWGzfRTNoXzVbJFXCGkkATMwI13SCYd5muv1Vd/3cb+Gn\n2ggvPc/h/jQnD7yE9YRvknvsztyLA2uxJZS6NhZkMMPjx0jj/Em9iNZlhqD6OlY8\n4t5H0Mom7BjihsZLpaztt3L3B5952VVkshxXwtoCZw2Wf/61NBbIeOGhhiDeFJiQ\nOQc1z7RHS8nx5N3naIefJEv4MTbzs7WN/wbXo0JydcnRK4oN1z9W4xqdfo+C7KbF\nWBaD8707STXRncAdjhlR5/hI/VqPlGb5Hx3xvrlRIke5gH/EQrAYD4I2YMAMDXKC\n0y3MuIZlqzGwkk1D2AT0slpP+Z6JYGL0AkoZZOl9njk5MXfP3FRS8u1GvT82EOHh\nuhqJjEuVeQBg6VvpBO/pEfNcT7fV9mY3xYoRW4XStWyilOEC1clPBUpMspQMqizx\nFWZ8bJIDG1fSEDNX2xlyUKvq6t4y5yHklw/sgf9qRz6aRIH+RUredJTEV2urQKYM\nP03wErejBEwxwmwKLXR0mYLTMR2m/ph4dzxqtjWbEqBrezwABNJJN16nfE2MUyGb\n2vygJuckJadHz9qkM30E\n=wMwa\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n",
          "payload": "tree 33fa47e0df65a17ad357cb52dae86be5d9c180b3\nparent d8fdc88fb970313247d8a180ac1ec3f6a10a8885\nauthor Raghu Chandra <rchandrasekharan@gmail.com> 1787977484 -0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787977484 -0700\n\ndocs(community): Add Enterprise Interest Group charter (#2626)\n\n* docs(community): Add Enterprise Interest Group charter\n\nCharter for the MCP Enterprise Interest Group, co-facilitated by Raghu Chandra and Yannj_Fr. Reviewed by 13 participants from Saxo Bank, Nordstrom, Boomi, Okta, Blue Shield of California, Silex Data Solutions, TraceForce, GNS-Foundation, EmpowerID, Solo.io, and Archestra.\n\n* Update docs/community/enterprise-ig/charter.mdx\n\nCo-authored-by: Joey Orlando <joseph.t.orlando@gmail.com>\n\n* Tighten scope to requirements-gap focus per review\n\n* Fix markdown formatting (prettier)\n\n* Incorporate review feedback: stateless transport, scope, related groups\n\n* Add opportunity framing to In-Scope per review\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Joey Orlando <joseph.t.orlando@gmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: Ola Hungerford <olahungerford@gmail.com>",
          "verified_at": "2026-08-29T04:24:44Z"
