          "date": "2026-08-31T03:27:27Z"
        },
        "message": "docs: regenerate rendered output for SEP-2549\n\nFixes the failing Render SEPs job:\nhttps://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/modelcontextprotocol/actions/runs/33339583528/job/99332656804\n\nPR #3310 fixed a typo in `seps/2549-TTL-for-list-results.md` without regenerating `docs/seps/`,\nso the rendered page still reads `serer` while its source reads `server`.\n\nThis makes `npm run check:seps` fail on main branch. Regenerated with `npm run generate:seps`.",
