        },
        "message": "docs: add MCP Apps demo to the apps overview page\n\nShow what an MCP App looks like before explaining how one works. The\nrecording is the Excalidraw demo from the ext-apps repository.\n\nRe-encoded from the upstream 10.3 MB source to 4.1 MB (25 -> 10 fps,\n160-colour palette, no dithering) at the original 620x510, so the page\ndoes not ship an asset five times heavier than any other image in the\nrepo.",
