          "payload": "tree 571f4fc07623a3cfad73efcbffab0a9ff2a5cec6\nparent 00c3f2e7885870a6b8261c670e7efbc9b1a4a886\nauthor Den <53200638+localden@users.noreply.github.com> 1790082520 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790082520 +0000\n\nFix expired Discord invite on Financial Services IG charter (#3383)\n\nThe Operations section linked #financial-services-ig to an invite code\nthat has expired. Point it at the standing MCP Contributors invite used\nelsewhere in the community docs.\n\nReported by @Adeniyikayodee. Fixes #3346",
