    {
      "sha": "1e9b1891be34ccba1f8c54b6c26c89ce4085ef01",
      "node_id": "C_kwDOM2nIG9oAKDFlOWIxODkxYmUzNGNjYmExZjhjNTRiNmMyNmM4OWNlNDA4NWVmMDE",
      "commit": {
        "author": {
          "name": "Den",
          "email": "53200638+localden@users.noreply.github.com",
          "date": "2026-09-22T13:08:44Z"
        },
        "committer": {
          "name": "GitHub",
          "email": "noreply@github.com",
          "date": "2026-09-22T13:08:44Z"
        },
        "message": "Remove duplicate border above the LF Projects footer notice (#3382)\n\nfooter.js appends the copyright notice as a child of Mintlify's\n`#footer`, which is a flex row that already draws a top border. The\nnotice carried its own `border-top` plus top margin and padding, so it\nrendered as a second rule offset below the first and pushed the text\ndown past the social icons.\n\nDrop the extra border and spacing, let `#footer` wrap, and give the\nnotice a 32rem flex basis so it sits beside the social icons when the\ncontent column is wide enough and drops to its own centered line when\nit is not. footer.js is kept so the lfprojects.org link stays clickable.\n\nReported by @TobCar, who proposed the layout. Fixes #3357",
        "tree": {
          "sha": "073eab83ebb13581cecd2dd0900aafe8eeb75ab8",
          "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/modelcontextprotocol/modelcontextprotocol/git/trees/073eab83ebb13581cecd2dd0900aafe8eeb75ab8"
        },
        "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/modelcontextprotocol/modelcontextprotocol/git/commits/1e9b1891be34ccba1f8c54b6c26c89ce4085ef01",
        "comment_count": 0,
        "verification": {
          "verified": true,
          "reason": "valid",
          "signature": "-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqsn3cCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAgVAQAIBek5RnNIhUlsQW5kFMhKXJ\nWtAV37o2OSD1jnQJqXja8a88SyUq6vyxcVlSjmwXMlL7Rz2MZvKODFSFlLjZW4la\naZGLtJ8XjbigiXpJolHmX7b8CUqqa81HuXYnCcGh1Q8+dqJ+wmaxqGiiIGIJiNUf\nx2hwGZTm54ZG6IiI+QhLSsRtWAZZFyrKVxHlrzlonjw2x0nNHK4E0+DvV9tGzh6Z\nPBG4V7Lr4xsBruxlAKcDfNSbM5pnRsXBDDvit2vGkmdeVh92xsktCHh2JgdOPLSe\nzYrFub8D/3MlYwJjy99p/QlNXwzTdVF4tDYFi2E0zQG+DYIaDsN4KiTQL/R1c9/z\n9GYkPJNW66sN3Ujmw1qC2KQV2ztipPOBlwSw1ubtrGteFfPvvNjKVsANSNlJboG4\nzxu958RVF0FnlYlOhLIUwn4EjRq9h1fM4apZSSpVQlpGSCREfX7nnu3RE0H4iyAP\nerX4V2FVLMZshQ5b8H3Ly4I1iYjAlBaRSpjhev0N+fXt7tSFj8qqLX0H/G4RZ4m6\nkYDvU8hsPJpWYmVO7Gu/VB/LUXkCBMrldDOZNNAXq3S4mfhK+HMI6gePJ9fwzz3g\ngzbIwTDbymWrWqN6hecpqdCRMvttZ3JMRpMsqRXAJaP5J6M59CJNNLK5uKtb+qkT\n3AzW97J5i8rF64eRQOH1\n=KCuC\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n",
          "payload": "tree 073eab83ebb13581cecd2dd0900aafe8eeb75ab8\nparent ab9ddca60b81cec2d2d6d0f51c5290c28b6fae5d\nauthor Den <53200638+localden@users.noreply.github.com> 1790082524 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790082524 +0000\n\nRemove duplicate border above the LF Projects footer notice (#3382)\n\nfooter.js appends the copyright notice as a child of Mintlify's\n`#footer`, which is a flex row that already draws a top border. The\nnotice carried its own `border-top` plus top margin and padding, so it\nrendered as a second rule offset below the first and pushed the text\ndown past the social icons.\n\nDrop the extra border and spacing, let `#footer` wrap, and give the\nnotice a 32rem flex basis so it sits beside the social icons when the\ncontent column is wide enough and drops to its own centered line when\nit is not. footer.js is kept so the lfprojects.org link stays clickable.\n\nReported by @TobCar, who proposed the layout. Fixes #3357",
          "verified_at": "2026-09-22T13:08:45Z"
        }
      },
