    {
      "sha": "dc48f37d9ee9f78081256e694ed11b73267787df",
      "node_id": "C_kwDOM2nIG9oAKGRjNDhmMzdkOWVlOWY3ODA4MTI1NmU2OTRlZDExYjczMjY3Nzg3ZGY",
      "commit": {
        "author": {
          "name": "Den",
          "email": "53200638+localden@users.noreply.github.com",
          "date": "2026-09-22T13:08:53Z"
        },
        "committer": {
          "name": "GitHub",
          "email": "noreply@github.com",
          "date": "2026-09-22T13:08:53Z"
        },
        "message": "docs: fix invalid JSON in two example code blocks (#3381)\n\nTwo JSON examples in the published docs do not parse:\n\n- docs/specification/2025-06-18/server/tools.mdx: the Image Content\n  example is missing a comma after \"mimeType\". Also drop the stray blank\n  line Prettier could not reach while the block was unparsable.\n- seps/1330: the \"Legacy Single Select With Titles\" example uses curly\n  quotes around enumNames. Its \"default\" was also \"Green\", which is one\n  of the enumNames labels rather than an enum value; use \"#00FF00\" to\n  match the new-style example directly below it.\n\nRegenerate docs/seps/1330-*.mdx from the SEP source.\n\nFixes #3369\n\nCo-authored-by: Nas <36938454+Na5co@users.noreply.github.com>",
        "tree": {
          "sha": "6ff307f22caad718550db4ddb41bd786a1708eee",
          "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/modelcontextprotocol/modelcontextprotocol/git/trees/6ff307f22caad718550db4ddb41bd786a1708eee"
        },
        "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/modelcontextprotocol/modelcontextprotocol/git/commits/dc48f37d9ee9f78081256e694ed11b73267787df",
        "comment_count": 0,
        "verification": {
          "verified": true,
          "reason": "valid",
