        "message": "Fix \"Serves\" typo in resources capability text (#3380)\n\nThe sentence introducing the empty `resources` capability example read\n\"Serves that support neither `listChanged` or `subscribe`\". Correct it\nto \"Servers ... neither ... nor\" in the draft and 2026-07-28 pages.\n\nReported by @kenwith. Fixes #3373",
