          "payload": "tree c75af7c0b08a38600b144954654f65dbba86fa9c\nparent dc48f37d9ee9f78081256e694ed11b73267787df\nauthor Den <53200638+localden@users.noreply.github.com> 1790082538 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790082538 +0000\n\nFix \"Serves\" typo in resources capability text (#3380)\n\nThe sentence introducing the empty `resources` capability example read\n\"Serves that support neither `listChanged` or `subscribe`\". Correct it\nto \"Servers ... neither ... nor\" in the draft and 2026-07-28 pages.\n\nReported by @kenwith. Fixes #3373",
