          "email": "noreply@github.com",
          "date": "2026-09-28T21:54:27Z"
        },
        "message": "Add Ruby SDK Tier 1 assessment to SDK listing (#3248)\n\nPromotes the Ruby SDK from Tier 2 to Tier 1 in the SDK listing for the 2026-07-28 revision and the draft,\nper the Tier 1 application #3247, which carries the full SEP-1730 evidence and reproduction steps:\nserver conformance 67/67 and client conformance 50/50 across the frozen 2025-11-25 and 2026-07-28 requirement sets,\n100% issue triage, no P0s ever filed, stable v1.2.0, a 4-day spec-tracking gap, and all three required policies published.\n\nFollows the Tier 2 listing update (#3128) for its application (#3127).",
        "tree": {
          "sha": "413f720ab3871983336bf60d63802700b0183242",
          "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/modelcontextprotocol/modelcontextprotocol/git/trees/413f720ab3871983336bf60d63802700b0183242"
