          "payload": "tree 413f720ab3871983336bf60d63802700b0183242\nparent ab3a39c13bd23be691c2760e1c6c5c15a64582e1\nauthor Koichi ITO <koic.ito@gmail.com> 1790632467 +0900\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790632467 -0700\n\nAdd Ruby SDK Tier 1 assessment to SDK listing (#3248)\n\nPromotes the Ruby SDK from Tier 2 to Tier 1 in the SDK listing for the 2026-07-28 revision and the draft,\nper the Tier 1 application #3247, which carries the full SEP-1730 evidence and reproduction steps:\nserver conformance 67/67 and client conformance 50/50 across the frozen 2025-11-25 and 2026-07-28 requirement sets,\n100% issue triage, no P0s ever filed, stable v1.2.0, a 4-day spec-tracking gap, and all three required policies published.\n\nFollows the Tier 2 listing update (#3128) for its application (#3127).",
