        },
        "message": "docs: add /seps/{number} redirects for SEP pages (#3387)\n\nRequested in Discord: a URL like /seps/2596 should resolve without knowing the slug, as RFC links do.\n\nrender-seps.ts now writes one redirect per SEP into docs.json, replacing any managed /seps/<digits> entries on each run so check:seps keeps them current. The SEP index and guidelines mention the short form.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
