        "message": "docs: fix dead external links (#3399)\n\n- Spring AI: mcp-server-boot-client-docs.html never existed under that\n  name; the MCP Client Boot Starter page is\n  mcp-client-boot-starter-docs.html.\n- OWASP ASVS project page moved to owasp.org/projects/asvs.\n- GitHub Discussions live on the repository, not the organization.\n- The Anthropic support article 'Building custom connectors via remote\n  MCP servers' (11503834) was removed; point 'build your own remote\n  server' at this site's own build-server guide for each version.\n\nRemote-Dev: homespace\n\nCo-authored-by: Pratik Gandhi <travpreneur@gmail.com>",
