      "additions": 1,
      "deletions": 1,
      "changes": 2,
      "blob_url": "https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/modelcontextprotocol/blob/75db1e987cbbba6d170315dc99d0dfc440754aef/docs%2Fcommunity%2Finterest-groups%2Fsecurity.mdx",
      "raw_url": "https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/modelcontextprotocol/raw/75db1e987cbbba6d170315dc99d0dfc440754aef/docs%2Fcommunity%2Finterest-groups%2Fsecurity.mdx",
      "contents_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/modelcontextprotocol/modelcontextprotocol/contents/docs%2Fcommunity%2Finterest-groups%2Fsecurity.mdx?ref=75db1e987cbbba6d170315dc99d0dfc440754aef",
      "patch": "@@ -68,7 +68,7 @@ scopes validated problems into focused Working Groups or [SEPs](/community/sep-g\n - **[Server Card WG](/community/working-groups/server-card) / [Registry WG](/community/working-groups/registry)**:\n   server identity, provenance, and discovery metadata intersect with admission and supply-chain\n   concerns\n-- **Transports WG**: stdio process isolation and unauthenticated method surface\n+- **[Transports WG](/community/working-groups/transports)**: stdio process isolation and unauthenticated method surface\n - **SDK Maintainers**: coordinated handling of SDK security advisories and cross-SDK security\n   defaults\n "
    },
