      "changes": 8,
      "blob_url": "https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/modelcontextprotocol/blob/75db1e987cbbba6d170315dc99d0dfc440754aef/docs%2Fseps%2F2596-spec-feature-lifecycle-and-deprecation.mdx",
      "raw_url": "https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/modelcontextprotocol/raw/75db1e987cbbba6d170315dc99d0dfc440754aef/docs%2Fseps%2F2596-spec-feature-lifecycle-and-deprecation.mdx",
      "contents_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/modelcontextprotocol/modelcontextprotocol/contents/docs%2Fseps%2F2596-spec-feature-lifecycle-and-deprecation.mdx?ref=75db1e987cbbba6d170315dc99d0dfc440754aef",
      "patch": "@@ -13,6 +13,14 @@ description: \"Specification Feature Lifecycle and Deprecation Policy\"\n   </Badge>\n </div>\n \n+<Note>\n+  This SEP has reached Final status and is preserved as a historical record of\n+  the design as accepted. Changes made to the protocol after finalization are\n+  not reflected here. Refer to the [current\n+  specification](/specification/latest) and its changelog for authoritative\n+  requirements.\n+</Note>\n+\n | Field         | Value                                                                           |\n | ------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n | **SEP**       | 2596                                                                            |"
    },
    {
      "sha": "a845f59b2fbfe1a8ef489ef43b62d931e37d136b",
